{
  "name": "dsh-chanhub",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness 客户端插件：在设置侧边栏接入 chanhub（WorkBuddy2API）上游网关的可视化面板，复用 dsh-bridge-gateway 的设计语言。",
  "releaseNotes": "【dsh-chanhub 0.1.0】\n• 面板：5 Tab（账号池/任务/用量/日志/配置），对齐 dsh-bridge-gateway 设计语言\n• 批量动作条：签到/查余额/保活/旅行/活跃上报走网关真实任务端点\n• 账号面板排程区块（色块+明细，只表达配置与时间窗，不编造执行状态）\n• 配置保存优先走网关端点：可热改字段即时生效，需重启字段明确列出\n• C 类持久化计数透出：连续12153 / 退避指数 / 快过期积分\n• 配套网关：7 类任务手动触发与逐号结果、逐套餐积分、用量分桶、日志、成长码 accept/claim、模型实测上限透出\n• 无数据源的区块显式标注，不编造推断值",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "client",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README.zh.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build:client": "node client/build.mjs",
    "prepack": "npm run build:client",
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {},
  "devDependencies": {
    "esbuild": "^0.25.9"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": ">=0.1.0-rc.6"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "chanhub",
    "workbuddy2api",
    "gateway",
    "openai-compatible",
    "panel"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git@github.com:lament-z/dsh-chanhub.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/lament-z/dsh-chanhub/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/lament-z/dsh-chanhub",
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public",
    "registry": "https://registry.npmjs.org/"
  }
}
